 0mm | – |\n| 9:00 PM | 65°F | Overcast | 2 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 10:00 PM | 65°F | Overcast | 3 mph | 0mm | – |\n| 11:00 PM | 65°F | Overcast | 4 mph | 0mm | – |\n\n## 15-Day Forecast\n| Day | Conditions | High | Low | Rain % | Precip | Wind |\n|:----|:-----------|-----:|----:|-------:|-------:|-----:|\n| Sat 7 | Slight rain showers | 72°F | 61°F | – | 0.7mm | 6 mph ESE |\n| Sun 8 | Slight rain showers | 69°F | 64°F | – | 5.6mm | 17 mph SSE |\n\n...\n\n## Source\nWeather data by Open-Meteo.com (https://open-meteo.com/), licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Open-Meteo blends forecast models from ECMWF, Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), NOAA NCEP, the UK Met Office, the Japan Meteorological Agency and the Australian Bureau of Meteorology. Values are model output, not station observations. Units converted and values rounded by Exa."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

