data: {"id":"gen-1793944172-3ldcdI25Fz7FFadphvyQ","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944172,"model":"openai/gpt-5.4-nano","provider":"OpenAI","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://meteo.es/en/location/lisboa-pt/weekend-forecast","title":"Weekend weather in Lisboa | Friday to Sunday - Meteo.es","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weekend weather in Lisboa \n\n Friday 6 November — Sunday 8 November · 45m \n\n## Weekend summary\n\nFriday\n\n6 Nov\n\n 21° 10° \n\nSlight rain showers\n\n 40% \n\nSaturday\n\n7 Nov\n\n 19° 16° \n\nThunderstorm\n\n 82% \n\nSunday\n\n8 Nov\n\n 20° 18° \n\nThunderstorm\n\n 90%\n\n...\n\n## Saturday\n\n7 de November\n\nThunderstorm 19° 16° \n\nFeels like 20° / 16° \n\nPrecipitation 82% (19.3 mm) \n\nWind 15 km/h SE\n\nGusts 37 km/h\n\nUV Index 2.8\n\nSunrise / Sunset 07:10 — 17:30 \n\nSun hours 0h\n\n### Hourly detail\n\n 00:00 17° 43% \n\n 01:00 17° 46% \n\n 02:00 17° 49% \n\n 03:00 17° 51% \n\n 04:00 16° 54% \n\n 05:00 16° 56% \n\n 06:00 16° 58% \n\n 07:00 16° 60% \n\n 08:00 16° 61% \n\n 09:00 16° 62% \n\n 10:00 17° 62% \n\n 11:00 17° 63% \n\n 12:00 18° 65% \n\n 13:00 18° 67% \n\n 14:00 19° 70% \n\n 15:00 19° 73% \n\n 16:00 19° 76% \n\n 17:00 19° 78% \n\n 18:00 19° 80% \n\n 19:00 19° 81% \n\n 20:00 18° 82% \n\n 21:00 18° 82% \n\n 22:00 18° 82% \n\n 23:00 18° 82% \n\n## Sunday\n\n8 de November\n\nThunderstorm 20° 18° \n\nFeels like 20° / 17° \n\nPrecipitation 90% (33.5 mm) \n\nWind 26 km/h SSE\n\nGusts 46 km/h\n\nUV Index 3.7\n\nSunrise / Sunset 07:11 — 17:29 \n\nSun hours 3.7h"}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944172-3ldcdI25Fz7FFadphvyQ","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944172,"model":"openai/gpt-5.4-nano","provider":"OpenAI","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://www.theportugalnews.com/news/2026-11-04/weekend-weather-forecast/1110909","title":"Weekend weather forecast - The Portugal News","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weekend weather forecast\n\nRainy days are coming\n\n By TPN, in News · 04 Nov 2026, 15:03 · 0 Comments \n\n Credits: Unsplash; Author: Osman Rana; \n\nLisbon: On Saturday, there is a chance of rain, with temperatures reaching 21 degrees and dropping to 16 degrees at night; however, there is also a chance of sunshine. On Sunday, the chance of showers increases, although temperatures may reach 22 degrees, with some sunshine remaining. From Monday, rain is set to continue, with cloud cover increasing."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

data: {"id":"gen-1793944172-3ldcdI25Fz7FFadphvyQ","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1793944172,"model":"openai/gpt-5.4-nano","provider":"OpenAI","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://www.portugal-news.today/en/article/344700","title":"Weather forecast for November 6, 2026 — Portugal news","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"content":"# Weather forecast for November 6, 2026\n\nJornal de Mafra 5 November 2026 at 20:17\n\nThe weather forecast for November 6, 2026 covers the municipalities of Mafra, Ericeira, Sintra, Torres Vedras, Santa Cruz and Lisbon, with information for November 6 to 9. On Friday, November 6, rain or showers are expected in most locations, with minimum temperatures between 9º and 12º and maximum temperatures between 17º and 19º, and moderate southeast wind. In Lisbon, the wind will be light from the south. IPMA issued a yellow warning for the Lisbon district regarding precipitation, valid between 3:00 PM on the 6th and 12:00 AM on November 7th, warning of periods of rain or showers sometimes heavy and accompanied by thunderstorm. The warning was updated on November 5th at 7:23 PM. On Saturday, November 7th, the forecast indicates light rain or drizzle in Mafra and Lisbon, partly cloudy sky in Ericeira and Santa Cruz, and rain or light showers in Sintra and Torres Vedras, with temperatures rising to minimums between 14º and 17º and maximums between 19º and 21º, and predominantly moderate south or southwest wind. For Sunday, November 8th, rain or showers are forecast in Mafra, Sintra and Lisbon, light rain or drizzle in Torres Vedras, and rain or light showers in Ericeira and Santa Cruz, with temperatures ranging between 14º and 22º and moderate southeast wind in most locations. On Monday, November 9th, the trend is for continued rain or showers in all locations, with minimum temperatures between 15º and 17º and maximum temperatures between 20º and 22º, and moderate south or southwest wind.\n\n...\n\nThis is our short summary of a report published by Jornal de Mafra on 5 November 2026 at 20:17; the full text stays with the publisher."}}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

